        "text": "My family was doing something special. We wanted to make a picture by ourselves. “Do you understand what to do?” Mom asked. “I really do!” I said. I chose my clothes and got ready. Since everyone had a job, we finished quickly. My brother wanted to do his part himself, and I helped myself too. When Dad asked a question, I knew the answer. At the end, we looked at the picture and smiled.",
